  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the cozy warmth of the wild with this Southwestern-inspired quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a striking wolf design on smooth, comfortable material, this quilt brings both functional warmth and decorative style to your bedroom, living room, or outdoor adventures.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Touch:</strong> Customize this bedding with your own name or custom text input for a unique, personalized gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Southwestern Design:</strong> Features a realistic illustration of a wolf head blended with geometric tribal patterns, leaves, and a native theme.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Comfort:</strong> Soft, lightweight, and breathable material that keeps you cool in the summer and warm in the winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect as a decorative bed set, a cozy throw for reading on the sofa, or for extra warmth during camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Fully machine washable in cold water for simple maintenance and quick air drying.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Complete your bedding set by adding two optional matching pillow covers (20''x30'').</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>30% Cotton, 70% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Wolf Theme Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
